# Chroma-Craft Cursor Rule

When writing or editing CSS, Tailwind CSS, or frontend components:
- Always use the 46-color canonical palette in `chroma-craft/skill/references/color-roster.md`.
- Adhere to the strict blue rule: only use `Ice Blue`, `Baby Blue`, `Ocean Blue`, `Midnight Blue`, `Electric Blue`, `Arctic Blue`, and `Steel Blue`.
- Apply domain archetypes:
  - E-Commerce: Pristine Snow White (#FBFBFD) canvas, Amber Gold (#F59E0B) or Forest Green (#228B22) CTA. No noisy gradients behind product photos.
  - Corporate: Midnight Blue (#191970) or Steel Blue (#4682B4) with Snow White. Sober, zero shiny jigmig.
  - Hackathons: Charcoal Onyx (#121214) dark canvas, Electric Blue (#0066FF) + Cyan (#00E5FF) neon gradients.
- Enforce WCAG 2.1 AA contrast: body text >= 4.5:1, large text / UI borders >= 3.0:1.
